        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $u,v$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 \\\\ -8 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & -3 & -3 \\\\ -8 & 8 & 9\\end{array}\\right]\n$$",
